            "Key": "RuneLoggingAxe",
            "SourceString": "To a tree, a human with a rune logging axe is their final boss. You are the ultimate test; the nemesis that they have been training for. They have been stretching their branches and aggressively photosynthesising for this moment. They have been fantastising about taking you down, so that they can be talked about in groves for centuries. 'The Lumberjack Ripper', they think. 'That's what they will call me.'",
